# Kodi Media Center language file
# Addon Name: FCast Receiver
# Addon id: service.fcast.receiver
# Addon Provider: ozankiratli
#
# en_gb is not a choice: LANGUAGE_DEFAULT in Kodi is the literal string
# "resource.language.en_gb", and it is loaded behind whatever language the
# user has set, for every add-on. It is also the only language whose strings
# Kodi takes from msgid rather than msgstr - which is why every msgstr below
# is empty. A translation goes in a sibling folder (resource.language.de_de
# and so on) with the English left in msgid and the translation in msgstr.
